}}
{{Splduplicatenotes
| name = Stifling Dagger
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus t2l}} Only the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted offensive cast procs [[Spell Duplication]] sources.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Does not break {{A|Phantom Assassin|Blur}}'s {{M|invisibility}} upon cast, but not other invisibility sources.

* Cannot be cast on the following units:
** {{M|Couriers}}

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{cf|talnotes}} Launches {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Stifling Dagger value1 tal}}-{{#var:Stifling Dagger value1}}}}|25tal}} additional dagger {{M|projectiles}} toward random {{M|vision|text=visible}} enemy units, without priorities, within radius [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] .
*#* {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{to}} [[File:Dota2 Phantom Assassin Triple Strike Visualized icon.png|84px]]
*#** Can affect other non-unit-targeted enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1+{{#var:Stifling Dagger type2 value1}}|v1={{#var:Stifling Dagger cast range}}}}|25tal}}-distance away with the [[cast range]] and secondary targets search radius.
*#** Affects the outer circle within the cast range, Circle [[File:Dota2 Letter-b.png|21px|B]] .
*#** The search radius is centered around the primary target, when no other valid targets are available, nothing happens.
*#** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*#*** All projectiles are launched from Mortred's current position.
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*#* Applies the following ability effects upon [[projectile]] impact:
*#** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
*#*** Grants a 3.34-second 450-radius [[flying vision]] centered around the affected enemy upon impact.
*# {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*#* Applies the [[instant attack]] factor on Mortred's {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Base}} {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Bonus}} [[Attack Damage#Total Attack Damage|total attack damage]] value, including bonus {{M|conditional attack damage}} sources.
*#* Grants the {{M|unique bonus attack damage}} for the Stifling Dagger projectile. Hence, the instant attack damage is loosely defined as:
*#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|DmgInstance {{=}} ([[Attack Damage#Total Attack Damage|ΣAtk]] × f(InstantAtk)) + {{#var:Stifling Dagger value3}}}}
*#* The projectile-based instant attack is considered a {{M|melee}}-based attack sourced from Mortred.
*#* Procs {{M|attack modifiers}} and {{M|on-cast effects}} as per normal, except {{A|Doom|Infernal Blade}}, {{A|Kunkka|Tidebringer}} and {{A|Slark|Saltwater Shiv}}.
*#** {{M|Cleave}} and {{M|splash}} damage instances are applied on the affected enemy's position, damaging a [[Wikipedia:trapezoid|trapezoid]] area the opposite direction where the attacks came from.
*#*** {{Symbol|Attack Damage}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Target|Cleave90|size=42px}}
*#* Has {{M|True Strike}}.
*#* Not affected by {{M|disarm}} sources.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|phantom_assassin_stiflingdagger}}
*#* Applies the {{M|movement speed}} slow.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Stifling Dagger icon0}}
| desc = Throws a dagger slowing the enemy unit's movement speed, dealing 65+30% of Phantom Assassin's attack damage as physical damage and applying attack effects from items and abilities.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Stifling Dagger basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

